  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for tolerance-aware numeric assertions on System.Numerics types and BCL primitives. v0.0.1 ships MathTolerance helpers for NaN-aware, infinity-aware comparison of double, float, and Vector3. The wider catalog (Vector2/4, Quaternion, Matrix4x4, Plane, Complex, span overloads, ULP-distance equality, rotational equivalence, statistics, linear-algebra invariants, number theory, 3D geometry) lands at 0.1.0. Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages, starting with MathAssertions.TUnit.",
